  <History Date="28-03-15" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created" />
  <History Date="26-06-15" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added 'Black out speed' function to Lamp channel and added 18 DMX mode in response to customer bug report." />
  <History Date="26-05-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added 16 DMX mode.  Added Atlabase ID's (note 18 DMX mode is not documented and therefore not simulated)." />
  <History Date="10-06-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from FOS Beam 7R Hybrid (alternative colours and gobos - Atlabase tested on real-world fixture and found manufacturer's charts incorrect)." />
  <History Date="17-02-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from FOS Beam 7R Hybrid (2)" />
  <History Date="23-02-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's." />
  <History Date="23-06-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added RDM ID's" />
  <Manual Filename="" Summary="" />
